    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After decades of peace, the Realms of Magic Typo were invaded by creatures of the Darkness! Now it is up to the <i>Legion of Wizzards</i> to reestablish the harmony that once existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Procedually generated Dungeons, using powerfull weapons and spell combinations to defend yourself! But be carefull! If your weapons run out of ammo, type the name of one of your spells to be able to shoot again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.poster.avif?t=1750090799\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.webm?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.mp4?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME ELEMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 different Items, including Spells, Weapons and Upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Progression through the Level Up System!New Game+ Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Different Pets to help you on your journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Different Skins for the Main Character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+ Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Additional Game Modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Different Areas with Unique Bosses and Enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-Op and Steam Remote Support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Mod Support!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.poster.avif?t=1750090799\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.webm?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.mp4?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After decades of peace, the Realms of Magic Typo were invaded by creatures of the Darkness! Now it is up to the <i>Legion of Wizzards</i> to reestablish the harmony that once existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Procedually generated Dungeons, using powerfull weapons and spell combinations to defend yourself! But be carefull! If your weapons run out of ammo, type the name of one of your spells to be able to shoot again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.poster.avif?t=1750090799\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.webm?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/505bd90fd6249b5a3eb0325a8fc48594.mp4?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME ELEMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 different Items, including Spells, Weapons and Upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent Progression through the Level Up System!New Game+ Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Different Pets to help you on your journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Different Skins for the Main Character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+ Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Additional Game Modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Different Areas with Unique Bosses and Enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-Op and Steam Remote Support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Mod Support!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.poster.avif?t=1750090799\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.webm?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542650/extras/133c8882384b8bb94581310c89da850e.mp4?t=1750090799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
